### 7. `main` Blueprint anpassen

Die Route `/provider/dashboard` im `main` Blueprint durch einen Redirect ersetzen:

```python
@main_bp.route('/provider/dashboard')
@login_required
@provider_required
def provider_dashboard():
    return redirect(url_for('provider.dashboard'))
```

